

com4                      Device Driver                      com4




Device driver for asynchronous serial line COM4


/dev/com4  is   the  COHERENT  system's   standard  interface  to
asynchronous serial  line COM4.  The interface  is assigned major
device 6, and is accessed as a character-special device.  The I/O
address  for the  corresponding 8250 SIO  is 0x2E8  (COM4).  com4
generates interrupt IRQ3.

Four versions of device com4 are in directory /dev, as follows:


